   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_66cc266aba621b65c372",
   "sourceHash": "66cc266aba621b65c3725b2a906a66bcc073c35e9811f2ca0bd65a6d203771af",
   "text": "借助阿育吠陀恢复身心平衡。在喀拉拉邦 Kairali Healing Village，通过正宗疗法、瑜伽与饮食调理，帮助排毒、焕活并提升活力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e9aaa02eae4ca1fc9a49",
   "sourceHash": "e9aaa02eae4ca1fc9a49bcc867d0ace6eb138cc694bfad6afda87f7e37e4f360",
   "text": "80% 的患者信赖我们的个性化阿育吠陀疗愈 | 已帮助 30,000+ 人改变生活",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'guests' rendered as 患者 (patients) per KTAHV language lock. Claim figures (80%, 30,000+) kept verbatim; they differ from the 100,000+ patients figure elsewhere on the page — flag for owner fact check."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9385b5308cbd9917b81b",
   "sourceHash": "9385b5308cbd9917b81b0d89ada89d2bf6ec8f439bcd1e9a3f33cf9243255f10",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 将正宗阿育吠陀与现代健康理念相结合，帮助深度排毒与焕活。我们的疗法——包括 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽，草药油按摩）、Shirodhara（希罗达拉，药油滴额疗法）和 Udvarthana（乌德瓦塔纳，草药粉按摩）——均采用园区内有机种植的纯天然原料。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d48a2465e0baf24e298f",
   "sourceHash": "d48a2465e0baf24e298f1a8d34aa200cb1d9c3258d1ac3b15fd8dbc4499d1fab",
   "text": "无论您是希望从职业倦怠中恢复、摆脱慢性压力的循环，还是希望在健康问题出现之前加以预防，我们的专业团队都会为您量身制定全面焕新的方案——私密、审慎且充满尊重。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8ccd627cdf5e64a1a2f4",
   "sourceHash": "8ccd627cdf5e64a1a2f4ac95343745bc2a6e8d75eb798ef2b3a3265e0dc8b0b6",
   "text": "历史与[[OPEN_1]]传承[[CLOSE_1]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b36b146b8e2f2b38537",
   "sourceHash": "4b36b146b8e2f2b38537eb11175e3586106252d70ec8ea18de53c0574470bec7",
   "text": "Kairali 代表着 [[VAR_1]] 多年的阿育吠陀疗愈传统，传承自喀拉拉邦丰富的医学渊源。疗愈村坐落于西高止山脉山麓 65 英亩的葱郁土地上，依照 Vastu Shastra（瓦斯图建筑学）原则建造，环境宁静、充满悦性（sattvic）气息。已有来自 50 多个国家的 100,000 多名患者在此接受了由医生监督的正宗阿育吠陀疗法，涉及多种健康状况。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
