   "sourceHash": "59b0e667a84b1db73a5ff20867feadbd4806abdcb19049702893d216dccdeeb4",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]][[OPEN_3]]个性化疗愈[[CLOSE_3]]：每一套治疗方案都根据患者的体质（prakriti）、健康需求和目标量身设计。[[CLOSE_2]]",
